  << /ActualText (1\056 On the back side of the exhaust cover\054 score one of the long grooves with a sharp utility knife three or four times\054 keeping the blade pulled away from your hand\056 Flex the scored flange back and forth until it snaps off\056 Repeat for the remaining three flanges\056)
