  << /ActualText (3\056 If there is no existing exhaust cover\054 cut an opening through the exterior cladding and wall assembly using one of the following methods\072 a\056 Hole saw\072 Drill a 4\0551\0574\042 diameter hole at the marked center point\056 b\056 Template and saw\072 Trace the supplied template onto the wall and cut the opening with a reciprocating saw or jigsaw\056)
